","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:p016","quote":"遷取王皇太后外孫修成君女為妃","mention_ids":["c-shiji-118-huainan:m016-0078","c-shiji-118-huainan:m016-0083"]}],"rationale":"原整段修成君女指女兒，但其中母親爵稱須另標。保留女兒原提及ID，縮為女字；妃姓名、父親與姓氏未知，不補。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:p016","text":"淮南王有女陵，慧，有口辯。王愛陵，常多予金錢，為中詗長安，約結上左右。元朔三年，上賜淮南王几杖，不朝。淮南王王后荼，王愛幸之。王后生太子遷，遷取王皇太后外孫修成君女為妃。王謀為反具，畏太子妃知而內泄事，乃與太子謀，令詐弗愛，三月不同席。王乃詳為怒太子，閉太子使與妃同內三月，太子終不近妃。妃求去，王乃上書謝歸去之。王后荼、太子遷及女陵得愛幸王，擅國權，侵奪民田宅，妄致繋人。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m016-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"淮南王","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AFA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m016-0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"女陵","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AFAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m016-0013","start":13,"end":14,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AFA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m016-0015","start":15,"end":16,"surface":"陵","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AFAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m016-0031","start":31,"end":32,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m016-0040","start":40,"end":41,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m016-0042","start":42,"end":45,"surface":"淮南王","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AFA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m016-0051","start":51,"end":54,"surface":"淮南王","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AFA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m016-0054","start":54,"end":57,"surface":"王后荼","kind":"person","person_id":"8ie_pfa_02i","status":"contextual_pro